  "limitations": [
    "15-second trials include 10-second wrk2 calibration; short integration benchmark, not maximum sustainable RPS.",
    "Direct TCP omits the L7 proxy; not an equivalent service-mesh baseline.",
    "Busy-poll CPU utilization includes idle spinning.",
    "One frontend in load trials; replica restart validation is a separate functional test.",
    "Cancellation/deadline probes use already-cancelled/expired contexts, not cancellation of a slow in-flight server operation.",
    "Tracing options preserved, but end-to-end trace-parent propagation was not separately inspected.",
    "GC and DB/cache CPU profiles, per-endpoint performance, host-dpa and W8/12/16 not measured."
  ],
  "excluded": [
